  "title": "Chicken Dopiaza",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken curry with double the onions",
  "excerpt": "Dopiaza means two onions: half are caramelised to a deep sweet base and the other half go in later for texture and bite. The result is a richly layered curry with more depth than its short ingredient list suggests.",
