        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Take the time to properly brown the first batch of onions. The dark, sticky caramelisation is what gives this curry its body and depth." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
